sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant API as Vemiq API
  participant DB as Supabase DB
  participant Worker as intelligence-worker
  participant Report as Report Context
  Client->>API: POST evidence
  API->>DB: Insert evidence_items
  DB->>DB: Enqueue intelligence_jobs
  Worker->>DB: Claim pending job
  Worker->>DB: Write entities, insights, clarifications
  Worker->>DB: Refresh documentation_health
  Report->>DB: Read report_evidence_context
  DB-->>Report: Evidence + insights + image placement
